# Per-model × per-run generation results.
# Layout (one subdirectory per model id, slashes preserved):
#   results/{model_id}/run_{1..5}/
#     attempts.jsonl              one JSONL row per target (prompt, response,
#                                 model_snapshot, tokens, latency_ms)
#     generated_tests/{repo}/{target_id}.cs
#     compile/{target_id}.log     present iff that target's test failed to compile
#     runtime/{target_id}.log     present iff that target's test compiled but
#                                 failed at runtime
#     outcome.csv                 target_id,compile_pass,test_pass,covers_target
#   aggregate.csv                 union of all run-level outcome.csv files,
#                                 with model_id and run_index columns added.
